{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鴨脷洲利東邨發生雙屍案，一對兄弟被發現倒斃在單位內。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.BODIES-1730 (2).jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ReXgnntNIF1789384935.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BODIES-1730 (2).jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警員接報後到場調查。下午約二時半，警方接獲利東邨東業樓一名保安員報案，指有單位傳出異味，消防破門入屋發現兩人，當場證實死亡。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">55歲哥哥當時倒卧在浴室，53歲弟弟則倒卧在房間。死因有待驗屍確定，警方正調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T15:59:40.873710+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}